helm/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/deployments","created_at":"2015-10-06T01:07:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T12:39:30Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T21:17:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/helm/helm.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:helm/helm.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/helm/helm.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/helm/helm","homepage":"https://helm.sh","size":26241,"stargazers_count":29174,"watchers_count":29174,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":7445,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":476,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":true,"topics":["chart","charts","cncf","helm","kubernetes"],"visibility":"public","forks":7445,"open_issues":476,"watchers":29174,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### What happened?\n\nHey,\nwhen running `helm dependency update --username xyz --password xyz .`, I always get a `401` when helm tries to communicate with my private chart repo. This does not happen when using OCI repos. This happens on `v3.17.4`, `v3.18.6`, `v3.19.0-rc1` and `v4.0.0-alpha.1`.\n\nAfter doing `helm repo add external-secrets-helm-remote https://xyz.jfrog.io/artifactory/api/helm/external-secrets-helm-remote --username xyz --password xyz`, it works. However, shouldn't this work without doing that? When my dependency is in a private OCI repo, the above works (except on 3.18 but there is a fix merged already). No `helm registry login` needed. \n\nI got this error with `v3.17.4`:\n```\nGetting updates for unmanaged Helm repositories...\n...Unable to get an update from the \"https://xyz.jfrog.io/artifactory/api/helm/external-secrets-helm-remote\" chart repository:\n        failed to fetch https://xyz.jfrog.io/artifactory/api/helm/external-secrets-helm-remote/index.yaml : 401\nError: no cached repository for helm-manager-1e5f91134fb5895deadfad8d514c142824341de25411e9780165b9b3281e1217 found. (try 'helm repo update'): open /home/marcel/.cache/helm/repository/helm-manager-1e5f91134fb5895deadfad8d514c142824341de25411e9780165b9b3281e1217-index.yaml: no such file or directory\nhelm.go:92: 2025-09-08 16:25:39.269342069 +0200 CEST m=+2.058369981 [debug] open /home/marcel/.cache/helm/repository/helm-manager-1e5f91134fb5895deadfad8d514c142824341de25411e9780165b9b3281e1217-index.yaml: no such file or directory\nno cached repository for helm-manager-1e5f91134fb5895deadfad8d514c142824341de25411e9780165b9b3281e1217 found. (try 'helm repo update')\nhelm.sh/helm/v3/internal/resolver.(*Resolver).Resolve\n        helm.sh/helm/v3/internal/resolver/resolver.go:127\nhelm.sh/helm/v3/pkg/downloader.(*Manager).resolve\n        helm.sh/helm/v3/pkg/downloader/manager.go:235\nhelm.sh/helm/v3/pkg/downloader.(*Manager).Update\n        helm.sh/helm/v3/pkg/downloader/manager.go:194\nmain.newDependencyUpdateCmd.func1\n        helm.sh/helm/v3/cmd/helm/dependency_update.go:81\ngithub.com/spf13/cobra.(*Command).execute\n        github.com/spf13/cobra@v1.9.1/command.go:1015\ngithub.com/spf13/cobra.(*Command).ExecuteC\n        github.com/spf13/cobra@v1.9.1/command.go:1148\ngithub.com/spf13/cobra.(*Command).Execute\n        github.com/spf13/cobra@v1.9.1/command.go:1071\nmain.main\n        helm.sh/helm/v3/cmd/helm/helm.go:91\nruntime.main\n        runtime/proc.go:283\nruntime.goexit\n        runtime/asm_amd64.s:1700\n```\n\nhelm doesn't seem to pass my provided credentials when using a non-OCI repo.\nI'm trying to avoid storing any credentials on disk, that's why I'm doing this via command options.\n\nAlso, what's the expected workflow when having multiple dependencies from different private repos in a `Chart.yaml`? \nWhat happens if there is a mix between public and private dependencies? How does helm infer to which registry/repo my credentials belong to? Will it \"leak\" my credentials when also trying to authenticate against a public repo?\n\n### What did you expect to happen?\n\nI expect a successful authentication and pull against my private repo. Something like this:\n```\nGetting updates for unmanaged Helm repositories...\n...Successfully got an update from the \"https://xyz.jfrog.io/artifactory/api/helm/external-secrets-helm-remote\" chart repository\nSaving 1 charts\nDownloading external-secrets from repo https://xyz.jfrog.io/artifactory/api/helm/external-secrets-helm-remote\nDeleting outdated charts\n```\n(taken and modified from a successful pull from public repo)\n\n### How can we reproduce it (as minimally and precisely as possible)?\n\nTo reproduce, create a helm chart with `helm create test`. then, add a dependency in `Chart.yaml`, e.g.\n```yaml\ndependencies:\n  - name: external-secrets\n    version: \"0.19.2\"\n    repository: \"https://xyz.jfrog.io/artifactory/api/helm/external-secrets-helm-remote\"\n```\n\nThen, run `helm dependency update --username xyz --password xyz`\n\n### Helm version\n\n<details>\n\n```console\n\n$ helm version\nversion.BuildInfo{Version:\"v3.17.4\", GitCommit:\"595a05da6166037d0abebaa27ac8a498fa4d7ed2\", GitTreeState:\"clean\", GoVersion:\"go1.23.10\"}\n$ helm version\nversion.BuildInfo{Version:\"v3.18.6\", GitCommit:\"b76a950f6835474e0906b96c9ec68a2eff3a6430\", GitTreeState:\"clean\", GoVersion:\"go1.24.6\"}\n$ helm version\nversion.BuildInfo{Version:\"v3.19.0-rc.1\", GitCommit:\"3d8990f0836691f0229297773f3524598f46bda6\", GitTreeState:\"clean\", GoVersion:\"go1.24.6\"}\n$ helm version\nversion.BuildInfo{Version:\"v4.0.0-alpha.1\", GitCommit:\"618b14a7723589887e02cd482dcd5a85768583cc\", GitTreeState:\"clean\", GoVersion:\"go1.24.6\"}\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n### Kubernetes version\n\nno interaction with kubernetes at this point","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31262/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/31262/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":20749128643,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOApspmc7EsTJrzwAAAATUvpPD","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helm/helm/issues/events/20749128643","actor":{"login":"scottrigby","id":407675,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzY3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/407675?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby","html_url":"https://github.com/scottrigby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scottrigby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-11-06T04:43:21Z","label":{"name":"Needs v3 backport","color":"b31cce"},"performed_via_github_app":